-------------------
GIBBS FREE ENERGY
-------------------

The Gibbs free energy is G = H - T*S

Total enthalpy                    ...   -749.91046519 Eh 
Total entropy correction          ...     -0.04636310 Eh    -29.09 kcal/mol
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Final Gibbs free energy         ...   -749.95682829 Eh

For completeness - the Gibbs free energy minus the electronic energy
G-E(el)                           ...      0.10888109 Eh     68.32 kcal/mol



